---
description: DQA read-only query execution and security requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

DQA is strictly read-only toward DEMIS.

Never implement direct execution of arbitrary LLM-generated SQL.

Executable SQL must come from an APPROVED and ENABLED Query Template.

Reject:
- DML
- DDL
- privilege changes
- transaction-control statements
- procedural blocks
- multiple statements

Use bound parameters.
Use execution timeout and row limits.
Use a read-only database account.
Use database read-only transaction/session support when available.

Never commit or expose credentials.
Mask sensitive connection data in logs and errors.

Security decisions must be deterministic application logic, not LLM judgment.
